OL,3,GNEWSATwo construction companies put    
OL,4,Ainto administration with 31 job losses 
OL,6,FTwo construction companies in the      
OL,7,FNewry-based O'Hare and McGovern Group  
OL,8,Fhave been put into administration with 
OL,9,Fthe loss of 31 jobs.                   
OL,11,FThe insolvency affects O'Hare &        
OL,12,FMcGovern Limited and OHMG (Holdings)   
OL,13,FLimited.                               
OL,15,FOther parts of the OHMG Group are not  
OL,16,Fin administration and continue to      
OL,17,Ftrade.                                 
OL,19,FStuart Irwin, Managing Director at the 
OL,20,Fadministrators Interpath, said the move
OL,21,Freflects "challenging conditions in the
OL,22,FNorthern Ireland construction market". 
